2. Part demolition of boundary wall, removal of 2no. vehicular entrances and provision of new pedestrian entrance /gate all onto rear / side on Templemore Avenue.
3. Construction of a new part single part two storey detached guest annex / ancillary accommodation to rear of main house with 3no. rooflights on rear facing roof and 2no. mini dormers on front facing roof;
