Permission for modifications to planning permission granted for a 5-9 storey 142 no. bedroom hotel under Ref. 3609/20 (ABP-309215-21) to facilitate its reconfiguration as a 105-suite aparthotel. 
Proposed modifications to facilitate the 105-suite aparthotel include the following: 
Basement: 
