The proposed modifications will increase the total number of age friendly apartments within Block E by 2 no., from 22 no. to 24 no., and the total number of residential units within the permitted Phase 1 residential development, as amended, from 179 no. to 181 no. units.

Change of use from warehouse to self-storage use;
