The development will consist of amendments to the permitted development as approved by South Dublin County Council under Planning Reg. Ref. SDZ23A/0018 comprising the Clonburris Development Areas CSW-S1 and CSW-S2 of the Clonburris SDZ Planning Scheme 2019 as follows: 
