xv. Proposed change from brick finish to render at ground and upper floor level of the western elevation; and,
xvi. The omission of dark render detail at upper floor levels on the western elevation. 
Site B (to the south of the permitted CSLS) the proposed amendments to the permitted layout and external elevations of Apartment Block B2 to include:
i. A change in window location at ground and upper floors on western elevation due to a change in apartment layout;
ii. Relocation of plant room door on ground floor level on eastern elevation;
iii. the provision of a new window ope at ground and upper floor levels on the northern elevation;
