v. Proposed change to fenestration arrangement on northern, southern, eastern and western elevations due to change in apartment layout;  
vi. Amendment to arrangement of stairway;
vii. Provision of 2 no. additional Automatic Opening Vents and increase in area for PV panels from 30 sq.m to 132 sq.m at roof level;
viii. The lowering of the higher roof parapet level from 75.32 AOD to 74.47 AOD on the western elevation;
ix. The amalgamation of 2 no. Plant Rooms, as approved under the parent permission, to provide for 1 no. single Plant Room (c.59.55 sq.m) and a Meter Panel Room (c.13.82 sq.m) located to the south of the Plant Room;
x. Proposed change from green roof to brown roof;
xi. The omission of dark render detail on the upper floors of the eastern elevation;
